cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use codegraph or its retrieval evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "codegraph: a cited code-structure index for Python and Java, with a labelled retrieval evaluation"
abstract: >-
  codegraph indexes Python and Java repositories into a symbol graph and answers structural
  questions (definitions, callers, inheritance, unused candidates, change impact) with a symbol
  identity and a file:line citation for every result, over a CLI and a read-only MCP server. It
  ships a 50-question hand-labelled evaluation that compares the graph with a text-search
  baseline and records hashes of every input.
type: software
authors:
